        <div class="drivers">October 27 election creates the primary transition pathway. Polls show Netanyahu's bloc at 53–54 seats — below the 61-seat governing threshold — with Yashar holding a marginal plurality. If Netanyahu cannot form a coalition by late November 2026, the President may task Eisenkot, which would constitute Netanyahu stepping down from the PM role. Weekly review only.</div>
      </div>
